# Trained model binaries: NOT committed on purpose (Decision 022). A model
# trained with one XGBoost version can fail to load with a different one
# ("input stream corrupted" -- this exact bug was hit and fixed earlier in
# this project). Regenerated fresh on your own machine/CI via:
#   python data/preprocess.py && python agents/triage_agent.py
data/*.joblib

# Cleaned dataset CSVs: also regenerable from the raw KDDTrain.txt/KDDTest.txt
# (which ARE committed) via data/preprocess.py -- excluding these keeps the
# repo smaller (~21MB saved) without losing anything, since they're a build
# artifact, not source data.
data/train_clean.csv
data/test_clean.csv
